- Se le zafó un tornillo.
- No puede rendirse.

65
00:05:39,464 --> 00:05:40,506
Nos abandonaron.

66
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:42,759
¿Voy a morir aquí?

67
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,469
Contrólate.

68
00:05:44,469 --> 00:05:45,845
Todos vamos a mo...

69
00:05:50,683 --> 00:05:51,893
Si te rindes,

70
00:05:52,393 --> 00:05:54,395
te mataré yo antes que tus dioses.

71
00:05:58,274 --> 00:05:59,275
Apresúrate.

72
00:06:00,068 --> 00:06:00,985
¡Vamos!

73
00:06:18,586 --> 00:06:19,504
<i>Pasan.</i>

74
00:06:26,219 --> 00:06:27,428
- ¡Vamos!
- ¡Caminen!

75
00:06:27,428 --> 00:06:30,348
- Rápido.
- ¡Uno, dos!

76
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:40,274
Apresúrate.

77
00:06:41,609 --> 00:06:43,986
<i>Deben patear el</i> jegi <i>cinco veces.</i>

78
00:06:43,986 --> 00:06:45,196
